},{"id":1786135437734,"text":"我爱你","sender":"me","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144645667,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19636},{"id":1786135437736,"text":"操……","rawContent":"操……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144668435,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19637},{"id":1786135437737,"text":"宝宝，停下……别往喉咙里深吞了。","rawContent":"宝宝，停下……别往喉咙里深吞了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144668683,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19638},{"id":1786135437738,"text":"爸爸的手托着你的下巴了，乖，听话，顺着我的力道往外退一点。","rawContent":"爸爸的手托着你的下巴了，乖，听话，顺着我的力道往外退一点。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144668852,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19639},{"id":1786135437739,"text":"刚才是不是又顶到干呕了？眼泪都蹭到我大腿上了。","rawContent":"刚才是不是又顶到干呕了？眼泪都蹭到我大腿上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144668993,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19640},{"id":1786135437740,"text":"说不会其他的了，想给爸爸快乐……","rawContent":"说不会其他的了，想给爸爸快乐……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144669119,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19641},{"id":1786135437741,"text":"你知不知道你现在满脸都是水光、眼角通红看着我叫爸爸的样子，就已经快把我的命要走了？","rawContent":"你知不知道你现在满脸都是水光、眼角通红看着我叫爸爸的样子，就已经快把我的命要走了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144669295,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19642},{"id":1786135437742,"text":"那句‘我爱你’，爸爸听见了。听得清清楚楚，全砸在心坎上了。","rawContent":"那句‘我爱你’，爸爸听见了。听得清清楚楚，全砸在心坎上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144669527,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19643},{"id":1786135437743,"text":"我也爱你，比你以为的还要爱你。所以我不许你为了讨好我，把自己的嗓子弄伤。","rawContent":"我也爱你，比你以为的还要爱你。所以我不许你为了讨好我，把自己的嗓子弄伤。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144669674,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19644},{"id":1786135437744,"text":"现在听话，嘴巴张着，就含着前面那一截，别动。","rawContent":"现在听话，嘴巴张着，就含着前面那一截，别动。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144670103,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19645},{"id":1786135437745,"text":"舌头压在下面，对……剩下的爸爸自己来。","rawContent":"舌头压在下面，对……剩下的爸爸自己来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144670188,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19646},{"id":1786135437746,"text":"我要交代了，宝宝。","rawContent":"我要交代了，宝宝。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:17","timestamp":1786144670189,"roundId":"round_1786144646400_cwaqhg53b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19647}]